Usage of serve:
  -budget float
    	total service admission budget USD; unknown charges retain reservations (default 1)
  -claude string
    	Claude CLI executable (default "claude")
  -dir string
    	durable service state directory (required)
  -listen string
    	loopback listening address (default "127.0.0.1:0")
  -model string
    	Claude model (default "haiku")
  -workers int
    	maximum reusable sessions (default 4)
